    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>

    <PackageReleaseNotes>## DapperGlib 1.6.0

DapperGlib 1.6.0 introduces a new metadata-based relationship system, eager loading, relationship aggregates, strongly typed query expressions, and additional relationship-loading APIs.

### Relationships

- Added attribute-based relationship definitions:
  - `[HasMany]`
  - `[HasOne]`
  - `[BelongsTo]`
- Relationship keys can omit the related key when both sides use the same property name.
- Added cached relationship metadata and model configuration validation.
- Added strongly typed relationship expressions using lambda expressions.
- Legacy `Relationship&lt;T&gt;` APIs remain available for existing code, while the new 1.6 relationship features use metadata-based navigation properties.

Example:

```csharp
[HasMany(nameof(UserId), Chaperone = true)]
public List&lt;Post&gt; Posts { get; set; } = new();

[HasOne(nameof(UserId))]
public UserProfile? Profile { get; set; }

[BelongsTo(nameof(UserId))]
public User? User { get; set; }</PackageReleaseNotes>

